            0.113,
            0.251,
            0.833,
            0.272
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Converting subtraction to addition and addition to subtraction",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.288,
            0.794,
            0.308
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Recall that "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Target Floor – Starting Floor = Movement needed",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.458,
            0.321,
            0.49,
            0.336
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "or"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.194,
            0.348,
            0.752,
            0.369
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Target Floor = Starting Floor + Movement needed",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.379,
            0.833,
            0.4
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "If we start at 2 and wish to go to –3, what is the movement needed?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.408,
            0.833,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "First method:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Looking at the number line, we see we need to move –5 (i.e., 5 in the backward direction). Therefore, "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "– 3 – 2 = – 5",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ". The movement needed is –5."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.483,
            0.815,
            0.503
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Second method:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Break the journey from 2 to –3 into two parts."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.506,
            0.596,
            0.525
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. From 2 to 0, the movement is 0–2=–2."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.528,
            0.617,
            0.548
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "b. From 0 to –3, the movement is –3–0=–3."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.551,
            0.83,
            0.571
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The total movement is the sum of the two movements: "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "– 3 + (– 2) = – 5",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.58,
            0.833,
            0.623
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Look at the two coloured expressions. There is no subtraction in the second one!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.633,
            0.834,
            0.699
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In this way, we can always convert subtraction to addition. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The number that is being subtracted can be replaced by its inverse and then added instead.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.709,
            0.834,
            0.774
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Similarly, a number that is being added can be replaced by its inverse and then subtracted.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " In this way, we can also always convert addition to subtraction."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.777,
            0.271,
            0.797
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Examples:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.806,
            0.412,
            0.826
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_13_equation_23.jpg",
          "content": "(+7)-(+5)=(+7)+(-5)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.829,
            0.408,
            0.848
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "b. (– 3) – (+ 8) = (– 3) + (– 8)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.852,
            0.408,
            0.871
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "c. (+ 8) –(–2) = (+ 8) + (+ 2)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.874,
            0.409,
            0.894
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "d. (+ 6) – (– 9) = (+ 6) + (+ 9)"
            }
          ]
        },
